<h2>How to judge a quote</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Is copywriting included?</strong> The single biggest hidden variable.</li>
  <li><strong>Is local SEO included or an add-on?</strong> Get the add-on price before you compare.</li>
  <li><strong>Whose name is the domain registered in?</strong> It should be yours.</li>
  <li><strong>What happens if it doesn't bring in work?</strong> Most will say nothing. That's the standard answer, and it's worth noticing.</li>
  <li><strong>What does a change cost after launch?</strong> Ask now, not in six months.</li>
  <li><strong>Can I leave and take the site?</strong> If the answer is complicated, that's your answer.</li>
</ol>

